            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Claude Opus 5.5 is priced

Keen had no rate for Claude Opus 5.5, so it counted every Opus 5.5 turn as $0.00.

Version 1.1.2 adds [Anthropic's published rates](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/pricing). The first time it opens, it prices the Opus 5.5 turns already recorded, so any day you used Opus 5.5 will show a higher total.

Per million tokens:

- Input $4, output $20
- Cache writes $5 (5-minute) and $8 (1-hour), cache reads $0.20
- Through Amazon Bedrock, 10% more: Keen uses Bedrock's regional rates
]]></description>
